# OilPrice.com

> OilPrice.com is a premier platform for real-time energy market data, geopolitical energy analysis, commodity prices, and global oil and gas industry news.

- domain: https://oilprice.com
- preferred-language: en
- sitemap: https://oilprice.com/sitemap.xml
- contact: support@oilprice.com
- canonical-structure: "/, /oil-price-charts, /futures/*, /energy/*, /latest-energy-news/*, /Alternative-Energy/*, /Geopolitics/*, /Finance/*, /Metals/*, /Interviews/*, /Company-News/*"

## Core Energy & Market Analysis (High Priority)

- [Oil Price Charts](https://oilprice.com/oil-price-charts/): Canonical index for real-time benchmark prices including WTI, Brent, Natural Gas, and regional crude blends.
- [Energy News](https://oilprice.com/energy/): Expert analysis and coverage of global oil, gas, renewable energy, and power markets.
- [Latest Energy News](https://oilprice.com/latest-energy-news/): Up-to-the-minute updates and breaking developments across the energy industry.
- [Geopolitics](https://oilprice.com/Geopolitics/): Analysis of OPEC+ strategy, international policy, trade route security, and geopolitical energy risks.
- [Alternative Energy](https://oilprice.com/Alternative-Energy/): Renewable energy coverage including solar, wind, nuclear, clean hydrogen, and energy transition minerals.
- [Finance & Markets](https://oilprice.com/Finance/): Energy sector macroeconomics, commodity trading analysis, and market investment trends.
- [Metals](https://oilprice.com/Metals/): Coverage of industrial and battery metals critical to global power and EV infrastructure.
- [Interviews](https://oilprice.com/Interviews/): Strategic Q&A sessions with executives, energy ministers, and leading commodity analysts.
- [Company News](https://oilprice.com/Company-News/): Corporate announcements, quarterly earnings, executive moves, and press releases across energy firms.

