- [WTI Futures](https://oilprice.com/futures/wti/): Real-time and historical West Texas Intermediate pricing and analysis.
- [Brent Futures](https://oilprice.com/futures/brent/): Real-time Brent crude futures charts and market updates.
- [Natural Gas](https://oilprice.com/futures/natural-gas/): Natural gas pricing, supply storage reports, and hub tracking.
